# apps/dashboard environment variables
#
# See /docs/SECRETS.md at the repo root for the full cross-service
# convention (where each value is stored, how to rotate it). This file
# only lists what apps/dashboard itself reads.
#
# Real values are never set here or in any .env file committed to the
# repo — only in Vercel: Project Settings > Environment Variables
# (separate values per Preview/Production if they ever differ). For
# local dev, copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) and fill it in.

# --- Supabase (Epic 2 — Auth & Account Foundations) ---
# Public by design: protected by Row-Level Security, safe to ship to the
# browser. Not yet wired in code as of issue 1.9 — placeholders only.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Sentry (Epic 19.1 — Observability) ---
# Not yet wired in code as of issue 1.9.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
